        "text": "Mitt Romney believes the Republican Party's future in the Senate is severely damaged by current internal conditions.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The House of Representatives is currently demonstrating the erosion of institutional norms and prerogatives due to crass politics.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
