        "text": "The speaker views political honesty as essential to maintaining institutional legitimacy.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Institutional norms and procedural integrity are valuable and worth preserving in legislative bodies.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Romney’s departure carries symbolic weight and signals broader systemic failure.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The deterioration of norms in government reflects deeper cultural and ideological conflicts.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "Audience members share concern about institutional decay in American politics.",
        "confidence": 0.84
      },
